 點多；營地最冷 ECMWF 凌晨 4 點 0.7 °C、GFS 凌晨 3 點 2.4 °C。往嘉明湖、三叉山（04:00–07:00）最低體感 ECMWF -0.9 °C、GFS 0.2 °C。氣象署 11/7 白天三叉山陰短暫雨 70%，晚上陰時多雲 20%，最低體感向陽山 3 °C、三叉山 5 °C。", "basis": "Open-Meteo ECMWF／GFS、氣象署一週與 3 小時預報、雨量站，11/4 22:58 查詢", "assessed_at": "2026-11-04T22:58+08:00"}, {"id": "confidence", "order": 5, "topic": "預報可信度", "level": "good", "headline": "剩 2 天出發，可信度算高了", "detail": "氣象署一週預報已涵蓋整段行程、延伸到 11/11，以氣象署為主；山區 3 小時預報推到 11/7 15:00。格點兩模式也正常抓到，跟 9 點那版幾乎一樣。", "basis": "Open-Meteo ECMWF／GFS、氣象署一週與 3 小時預報、雨量站，11/4 22:58 查詢", "assessed_at": "2026-11-04T22:58+08:00"}]}, "itinerary": {"rows": [{"day": "DAY 1", "time": "2026-11-06T10:00", "forecast_hour": "2026-11-06T10:00", "event": "起登", "place": "戒茂斯登山口", "elev_m": 1883}, {"day": "DAY 1", "time": "2026-11-06T10:30", "forecast_hour": "2026-11-06T11:00", "event": "經過", "place": "戒茂斯山前峰", "elev_m": 2065}, {"day": "DAY 1", "time": "2026-11-06T12:10", "forecast_hour": "2026-11-06T12:00", "event": "經過", "place": "戒茂斯山", "elev_m": 2510}, {"day": "DAY 1", "time": "2026-11-06T15:30", "forecast_hour": "2026-11-06T16:00", "event": "抵達營地", "place": "新武呂溪營地", "elev_m": 2208}, {"day": "DAY 2", "time": "2026-11-07T07:30", "forecast_hour": "2026-11-07T08:00", "event": "拔營出發", "place": "新武呂溪營地", "elev_m": 2208}, {"day": "DAY 2", "time": "2026-11-07T11:00", "forecast_hour": "2026-11-07T11:00", "event": "經過", "place": "足球場營地", "elev_m": 2769}, {"day": "DAY 2", "time": "2026-11-07T15:00", "forecast_hour": "2026-11-07T15:00", "event": "經過", "place": "嘉明湖妹池", "elev_m": 3150}, {"day": "DAY 2", "time": "2026-11-07T15:30", "forecast_hour": "2026-11-07T16:00", "event": "抵達營地", "place": "獵寮營地", "elev_m": 3130}, {"day": "DAY 3", "time": "2026-11-08T04:00", "forecast_hour": "2026-11-08T04:00", "event": "拔營出發", "place": "獵寮營地", "elev_m": 3130}, {"day": "DAY 3", "time": "2026-11-08T06:00", "forecast_hour": "2026-11-08T06:00", "event": "日出", "place": "嘉明湖", "elev_m": 3310}, {"day": "DAY 3", "time": "2026-11-08T07:00", "forecast_hour": "2026-11-08T07:00", "even